diff --git a/COMMIT_MSG b/COMMIT_MSG
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5b4a733
--- /dev/null
+++ b/COMMIT_MSG
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+Add weekly subscription support
+
+- Add WEEK cycle (charges every 7 days)  
+- Weekly cost converts to monthly: price × 52 ÷ 12, rounded to nearest cent
+- Update CLI to accept `--every week` option
+- Fix renewals sorting to order by date instead of lexicographic label
+- Add comprehensive tests for weekly subscriptions
+
+Weekly plans work like other cycles: add with `subtrack add "Meal kit" 59.90 --every week`, list shows monthly equivalent cost (€259.56 for €59.90/week), and renewals track charges every 7 days.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
